# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Format: /from /to status   (full https://host/* sources are allowed for
# host-level rules; first match wins, top to bottom).

# ── Retire korehannews.com → korehani.com (host-level 301) ───────────
# korehani.com is the canonical domain. Every old-domain URL should
# permanently redirect to the same path on the new domain so existing
# links, bookmarks and search rankings keep working.
#
# IMPORTANT: Cloudflare Pages' _redirects only does best-effort matching
# on the incoming hostname — the AUTHORITATIVE host-level redirect is a
# zone-level "Redirect Rule" in the Cloudflare dashboard on the
# korehannews.com zone (see repo PR description / chat for steps). These
# lines are a belt-and-suspenders fallback and require korehannews.com +
# www.korehannews.com to remain attached as custom domains on this Pages
# project. www.korehani.com → apex normalisation is safe to keep here.
https://korehannews.com/*      https://korehani.com/:splat      301!
https://www.korehannews.com/*  https://korehani.com/:splat      301!
https://www.korehani.com/*     https://korehani.com/:splat      301!

# Legacy paths from the korehannews.com era — not strictly redirects,
# but explicit so any old bookmarks or shared links that include
# /korehan/* prefixes still land correctly.
/korehan/*       /:splat       301

# Trailing-slash → no slash for the article reader URLs (some shared
# links include them).
/korehan-article/  /korehan-article.html  301

# Retired playground games (2026-10) → Playground hub.
/korehan-fun-fortune.html   /korehan-fun.html  301
/korehan-fun-worldcup.html  /korehan-fun.html  301

